    {
      "id": "sec_s1l10_r4",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Yeh jama ke alfaaz Qur'an-e-Majeed mein baar baar aate hain. Inhe achhi tarah yaad karein aur [الـ] ke saath mila kar buland aawaz se padhne ki koshish karein.",
        "content": "Yeh jama ke alfaaz Qur'an-e-Majeed mein baar baar aate hain. Inhe achhi tarah yaad karein aur [الـ] ke saath mila kar buland aawaz se padhne ki koshish karein.",
        "hinglish_text": "Yeh jama ke alfaaz Qur'an-e-Majeed mein baar baar aate hain. Inhe achhi tarah yaad karein aur [الـ] ke saath mila kar buland aawaz se padhne ki koshish karein."
      }
