      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Arabi zaban mein jama ke alfaaz aam taur par muannath (feminine) shumar hote hain. Upar zikr kiye gaye tamam jama alfaaz muannath hain.",
        "content": "Arabi zaban mein jama ke alfaaz aam taur par muannath (feminine) shumar hote hain. Upar zikr kiye gaye tamam jama alfaaz muannath hain.",
